SELECT 'gongkao', '行程问题', 'kp-xingce-quantity-math-operation-travel', CAST($${"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 1}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "行程问题"}]}, {"type": "highlightBlock", "attrs": {"backgroundColor": "#fffbeb", "borderColor": "#f59e0b", "icon": "💡"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "核心心法：", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "路程 = 速度 × 时间。万物不决画草图，熟练运用比例关系。"}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "一、题型定义与识别"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "题目中出现甲乙两人（或车）在某条路上“相遇”、“追及”、“往返”或“流水行船”。是数量关系中变化最多的题型。"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "二、核心公式"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "基础公式：", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " 路程 S = 速度 V × 时间 T"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "相遇公式：", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " 总路程 = (V甲 + V乙) × 相遇时间"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "追及公式：", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " 追及距离 = (V快 - V慢) × 追及时间"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "流水行船：", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " 顺水速度 = 船速 + 水速；逆水速度 = 船速 - 水速"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "三、标准步骤"}]}, {"type": "text-diagram", "attrs": {"type": "mermaid", "content": "flowchart TD\nA[阅读题目并提取要素] --> B[在草稿纸上画出线段图!]\nB --> C[标出已知要素: 距离、速度、时间]\nC --> D{是否有隐含条件?}\nD -- 路程一定 --> E[速度和时间成 反比]\nD -- 时间一定 --> F[路程和速度成 正比]\nE --> G[利用比例关系或套用基本公式列方程]\nF --> G\nG --> H[解方程得出答案]"}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "四、例题完整推导"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "【例题】", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " 甲乙两人从相距 300 米的两地同时相向而行，甲的速度是 4 米/秒，乙的速度是 6 米/秒。求多少秒后两人相遇？选项：A. 20  B. 30  C. 40  D. 50"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"start": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "识别：典型的直线相遇问题。"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "分析要素：总路程 S = 300，V甲 = 4，V乙 = 6。"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "套用相遇公式：S = (V甲 + V乙) × T相遇。"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "列式求解：300 = (4 + 6) × T相遇。得出 300 = 10 × T，T = 30 秒。"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "锁定答案：选 B。"}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "五、易错点纠偏"}]}, {"type": "highlightBlock", "attrs": {"backgroundColor": "#fef2f2", "borderColor": "#ef4444", "icon": "⚠️"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "不画图凭空想象：", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "行程问题一旦涉及到“往返相遇”或者“中途休息”，不画线段图去推算，大脑的内存绝对不够用。好记性不如烂笔头，行程问题第一步必须是画一条横线，标出起点和相遇点。"}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "六、刷题建议"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "强化对“比例法”的敏感度。遇到“速度提高了20%，时间提前了1小时”，立马反应出速度比是 5:6，时间比是 6:5，差的这 1 份就是 1 小时，瞬间得出原时间是 6 小时。这是秒杀行程高难题的核心武器。"}]}]}$$ AS jsonb), NULL, '行程问题的核心考点与实战推导。', category_node.id, CAST('["数量关系", "数学运算", "行程问题"]' AS jsonb), FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, NOW(), 0, 0, CAST('{"content_type": "knowledge_point", "category_code": "kp_xingce_quantity_math_operation_travel", "source": "fba_content_engine"}' AS jsonb), 1, NOW()
